Subject: [PATCH] fix(plugins): port H1-H9 host wiring onto 1001 line

Host-computed budgetSpentFraction stamp (H5/H6), runBudgetSpentFraction
helper with NaN/Inf drop (H3), cancel-run-invocations reap (H9), and
plugin-budget surface, ported from the tog-line port onto the live 1001
base. Live carries none of the H1-H9 symbols; this adds only the missing
deltas, nothing else.

Co-Authored-By: Paperclip <noreply@paperclip.ing>
